# Nivo POS (.cursorrules) — Permanent AI Architecture & Style Standards

You are working on Nivo POS (nivopos.in), India's Next-Gen Retail & Distribution Operating System. Follow these strict rules on every request:

1. DESIGN SYSTEM TOKENS (OPTION 3 — LIGHT BUSINESS SAAS):
   - App Canvas Background: #F4F6F9 (class: bg-nivo-bg)
   - Card / Surface Background: #FFFFFF (class: bg-nivo-card / bg-white)
   - Subtle Borders / Dividers: #E2E8F0 / #CBD5E1 (class: border-nivo-border)
   - Primary Heading & Text: #0F172A / #1E293B (class: text-nivo-ink / text-nivo-inkLight)
   - Secondary / Muted Text: #64748B (class: text-nivo-muted)
   - Primary Brand Accent: #4338CA, hover #3730A3 (class: bg-nivo-indigo hover:bg-nivo-indigoHover)
   - Secondary / Active Accent: #0D9488 (class: text-nivo-teal / bg-nivo-teal)
   - Warning / Low Stock Accent: #D97706 (class: text-nivo-amber / bg-nivo-amber)
   - STRICT PROHIBITION: NEVER use dark black backgrounds (#000, #0a0a0a, slate-950, #070A11, #0B1120) or neon green. Always use the Light Business SaaS palette.

2. MULTI-TENANT DATA ISOLATION:
   - Every Supabase query on store tables (products, invoices, invoice_items, customers, etc.) MUST explicitly filter and insert with `store_id: session.user.id` (auth.uid()).

3. ZERO DUMMY UI & ZERO DEAD BUTTONS:
   - Never render fake/mock product rows (no hardcoded Atta/Oil/Butter).
   - Render clean empty states when zero items exist.
   - Every button, tab, and link must perform a real working action (Supabase CRUD, window.print(), WhatsApp wa.me link, qrcode.react).
   - Never render placeholder/coming soon buttons or dead UI.
   - Keep /hq-admin strictly hidden (zero links on public pages) and gated only by public.hq_admins.

4. PERFORMANCE & STABILITY:
   - Clean React state and Tailwind CSS.
   - Avoid heavy layout animation loops or recursive useEffect hooks.
   - Maintain 0ms instantaneous UI responsiveness for counter retail speed.

5. TECH STACK RESTRICTIONS:
   - Permitted: React + Vite + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS + Supabase + Cloudflare R2 + Groq API.
   - Never add Gemini packages or references.
   - Never touch or modify .env or .gitignore.
